              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhaane yivi kandi kihanwa chiwaini komeeda ku vihaanwa viu kusambwa via vuli lidiku harara ni kihanwa chu vuswage.",
          "type": "text",
